  {
    "hotel_id": "178559",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/hotel-1001-malam/hotel/yogyakarta-id.html",
    "name": "Hotel 1001 Malam",
    "detail": "Pros: The location of the hotel is excellent, in the alley opposite Yogyakarta train station, just 100m from the station to the hotel and 300m walk to Malioboro shopping area. There are many hotels and motels here, but I think this is the best hotel in this alley area. The hotel has lots of green trees so it's cool though it's extremely hot outside. Room are airy, bathroom is large very clean, hot water and hand basins outside are convenient. Breakfast is delicious and it's delivered to your room. There is a hot water tank for you to make tea and coffee at all times at the lobby. The hotel staff is extremely enthusiastic. They prepared take-away breakfast for us because we went to Borobodur very early. Laundry service of the hotel is very cheap, only from 10k IDR / kg, may be cheaper than laundry shops outside. You can book transportation services at hotel to go to the famous tourist attractions, or next to the hotel there are shop offering this service. Cons: Wifi signal is weak.",
